Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"forward"}

Thought: Use a metric‑ranked subset (top 7 by rmse) and a robust weighted combination to test if trimming improves over full weighted.  
Action: select_top_k  
