Action Input: {"pool":"pool4","k":3,"metric":"rmse"}

Thought: Test a per‑horizon weighted mean on the stable 7‑model pool (trend‑dominated, unstable ranking) to see if focusing on the best models per horizon improves SMAPE.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: Try a per‑horizon weighted strategy (best_per_horizon) on the full pool to see if horizon‑specific dominance helps in this trend‑dominated series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"best_per_horizon"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination with inverse_error weights on the full model pool to see if explicit error weighting improves over the robust median.  
