Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: The series has a very strong trend and unstable rankings; a robust statistic on a smaller, diverse pool may improve over full-pool median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: test a forward‑selection weight on the full pool to see if greedy addition improves robustness in this trend‑dominated series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"forward"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using the inverse_error handle (w1) to see if a robust weighted scheme improves over median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: The series has unstable rankings and strong trend; a per‑horizon weighted mean may capture changing best models across horizons.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"topk_per_horizon","k":3,"metric":"rmse"}

